  ('de_DE', 16, '<p>Those documents are full documents you can open (<b><b>Shipment (Customer)</b></b>, <b>Invoice (Customer)</b>): customer, document type, lines, prices and totals are copied from the order. They are then <b>posted</b> to the books, the way iDempiere''s accounting processor posts completed documents: the invoice debits <i>Accounts Receivable</i> and credits <i>Revenue</i> (and <i>Tax Due</i> when there is tax); the shipment debits <i>Cost of Goods Sold</i> and credits <i>Product Asset</i> at the product''s current average cost.</p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERP_FirstSetup/#step-9-complete-the-order" target="_blank">Step 9 · Complete the order …</a></p>', 0),
  ('zh_CN', 1, '<p><strong>1 · 销售订单</strong></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERPUserGuide/#1-sales-order" target="_blank">1 · 销售订单 …</a></p>', 113),
  ('zh_CN', 2, '<p>从菜单（⌂ → 销售）打开<b><b>销售订单</b></b>，建一两行，然后按<b>处理</b>按钮（§6）→ <b>完成</b>。完成不只是改变状态：<code>completeIt</code> 会在同一个已签名的操作组里，接着生成后面的出货单和发票。</p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERPUserGuide/#1-sales-order" target="_blank">1 · 销售订单 …</a></p>', 113),
  ('zh_CN', 3, '<p><strong>Sales Order</strong></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Sales Order …</a></p>', 113),
