  ('de_DE', 8, '<p><b>When it refuses</b>, legacy says: “Either Order or RMA can be process on this document.”; “Period Closed”; “Back-Date transaction not allowed”; “No Document Lines found”; “Attribute Set Mandatory (Line No #… , Product=… )”; “Open: Ship/Receipt Confirmation”; “Insufficient Stock Coverage. A shipment should not be allowed if there is insufficient stock before the shipment’s movement date.”; “More than line qty on attribute tab for line …”; “Cannot correct Inventory OnHand (MA) [… ] - …”; and 9 more in MInOut.java.</p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Shipment (Customer) …</a></p>', 121),
