  ('en', 6, '<p><i>Read from iDempiere''s MMovementConfirm.java and the dictionary. ✓ = seen in a legacy run of 2026-11-23.</i></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Move Confirmation …</a></p>', 0))
