  ('en', 6, '<p><b>When it refuses</b>, legacy says: “No Document Lines found”; “Line No … : Fill mandatory fields: Attribute Set Instance”; “Document inventory subtype not configured, cannot complete”; “Current Cost for Line … have changed.”; “Storage on hand not updated for DateLastInventory”; “More than line qty on attribute tab for line …”; “Cannot correct Inventory (MA) - …”; “Transaction not inserted(2)”; “Cannot correct Inventory OnHand (MA) - …”.</p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Physical Inventory …</a></p>', 120),
