  ('en', 4, '<p><b>What Complete does.</b></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Cost Adjustment …</a></p>', 117),
  ('en', 5, '<ul><li>Internal Use Inventory: takes the internal-use quantity out of the locator''s on-hand stock (stocked products)</li><li>Physical Inventory: changes on-hand stock by counted minus book quantity (stocked products) ✓</li><li>Physical Inventory: stamps the storage records'' last-inventory date with the movement date</li><li>Cost Adjustment: moves no stock: the quantity difference stays zero so the line is skipped</li><li>Offers Close as the next document action</li></ul>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Cost Adjustment …</a></p>', 117),
  ('en', 6, '<p><b>When it refuses</b>, legacy says: “No Document Lines found”; “Line No … : Fill mandatory fields: Attribute Set Instance”; “Document inventory subtype not configured, cannot complete”; “Current Cost for Line … have changed.”; “Storage on hand not updated for DateLastInventory”; “More than line qty on attribute tab for line …”; “Cannot correct Inventory (MA) - …”; “Transaction not inserted(2)”; “Cannot correct Inventory OnHand (MA) - …”.</p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Cost Adjustment …</a></p>', 117),
  ('en', 7, '<p><i>Read from iDempiere''s MInventory.java and the dictionary. ✓ = seen in a legacy run of 2026-11-23.</i></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Cost Adjustment …</a></p>', 0))
